OL,3,GNEWSAPlans to turn disused bus depot
OL,4,Ainto budget hotel
OL,5,
OL,6,FA disused bus depot in a town centre
OL,7,Fcould become the site of a budget hotel
OL,8,Fif plans are approved.
OL,10,FProposals are set to be officially put
OL,11,Fforward for a 69-bedroom hotel on
OL,12,FBransty Row, in Whitehaven, by BEC, a
OL,13,Fproperty developer that previously
OL,14,Fturned the nearby bus depot into a
OL,15,Fbusiness hub and the former Whittles
OL,16,Fbuilding into a gaming centre.
OL,18,FBEC's chief executive, Michael
OL,19,FPemberton, said the hotel would be
OL,20,Foperated by a "nationally recognised
OL,21,Fbrand" and would bring "many more
OL,22,Fpeople into Whitehaven".
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
