OL,3,GNEWSAPlans to turn disused bus depot
OL,4,Ainto budget hotel
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe announcement comes just over a
OL,7,Fmonth after Cumberland Council approved
OL,8,Fa masterplan for the town - a strategy
OL,9,Fon how to develop the area in the
OL,10,Fcoming years.
